# Job Machine routing

Read @AGENTS.md first (canonical brief and fact-routing table), then
@docs/AGENT-PLAYBOOK.md for operating techniques and unauthenticated ATS JD
fetches. Do not restate facts from those files; follow them.

- Experience, dates, metrics, skills: only
  @resume-tailor-service/content/resume_bank.yaml. Never fabricate.
- Street, salary, exact work status, DOB, French, start date:
  `docs/PERSONAL-ANSWERS.md` (gitignored). If a value is blank, stop and ask
  Harsh. Never invent one.
- Live queue: dashboard `http://127.0.0.1:8420/`, then the newest
  `SESSION-HANDOFF-*.md`.
- Browser / CDP: @docs/BROWSER_PROFILE.md. Default regular Chrome via
  `start-chrome-debug.sh` + `BU_CDP_URL`; job profile only when Harsh asks.
  Attach on port 9222, never launch your own Chromium: `.cursor/mcp.json` is
  already pinned to `--cdp-endpoint`. One driver per profile at a time.
- Origin is PUBLIC. Never commit `docs/PERSONAL-ANSWERS.md` or
  `SESSION-HANDOFF-*.md`.
- Never re-send an application. Never send LinkedIn outreach without Harsh's
  approval of the exact message. No em-dashes in messages, drafts, or notes.
